 {r}←{dry}ReinstallAndUpdateTatinPackages type;parms;path;buff
⍝ Re-installes all packages in either packages/ (type=1) or packages_dev/ (type=2)
⍝ and updated them in the process, including to new major version numbers (!)
 r←0
 dry←{0<⎕NC ⍵:⍎⍵ ⋄ 0}'dry'
 'Right argument must be either 1 or 2'Assert(⊂type)∊1 2
 path←type⊃'packages' 'packages_dev'
 parms←⎕SE.Tatin.CreateReInstallParms
 parms.dry←dry
 parms.major←1
 parms.update←1
 buff←parms ⎕SE.Tatin.ReInstallDependencies ##.CiderConfig.HOME,'/',path
 ⍞←((⎕PW-1)⍴'-'),⎕UCS 10
 ⍞←↑buff
 ⍞←⎕UCS 10
 :If type=1
     ⍞←⎕UCS 10
     ⍞←'Use this function to copy packages from packages/ to APLSource/ :',⎕UCS 10
     ⍞←'#.Tatin.Admin.CopyPackagesToAPLSource',⎕UCS 10
 :EndIf
⍝Done
